","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/circle-crcl-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CRCL 2026 Q1","e":"crcl","d":"2026-05-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Allaire","x":"Last quarter, we talked about the rise of AI agents and the Agentic economy and the need for these AI agents to operate on economic infrastructure that enables trusted value exchange and economic coordination.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/11/circle-crcl-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CRCL 2026 Q1","e":"crcl","d":"2026-05-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Allaire","x":"As I noted at the outset, Arc is built as an economic OS that anticipates this convergence with AI operating systems, and we are accelerating our product investments in this space, both on top of Arc and by building on the wide range of applications and integrations that already exist for USDC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/11/circle-crcl-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CRCL 2026 Q2","e":"crcl","d":"2026-08-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Allaire","x":"DTCC underpins so much of our equities and securities markets today, and DTCC is collaborating with Circle to bring tokenized securities to Arc, focusing first on enabling the tokenization of DTC-custodied assets on Arc.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/circle-crcl-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CRCL 2026 Q2","e":"crcl","d":"2026-08-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Allaire","x":"DTCC will participate in running the Arc Layer-1 network and DTC tokenized assets will carry the same protections, rights and safeguards that investors receive with traditionally held assets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/circle-crcl-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CRCL 2026 Q2","e":"crcl","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Fox-Geen","x":"Adjusted operating expenses were $146 million, up 23% year-over-year, driven by continued investment in product development, go-to-market infrastructure and our AI capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/circle-crcl-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CRCL 2026 Q2","e":"crcl","d":"2026-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Fox-Geen","x":"We are increasing our full year outlook range to 41.7% to 43.7% from 38% to 40%, reflecting our prior guidance range augmented by the addition of anticipated revenue from Arc.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/circle-crcl-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CRCL 2026 Q3","e":"crcl","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Fox-Geen","x":"Adjusted operating expenses were $139 million, up 13% year-over-year, driven by continued investment in infrastructure to support Arc and AI and in marketing, including our partnership with Chelsea Football Club.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/circle-crcl-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CRCL 2026 Q3","e":"crcl","d":"2026-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Fox-Geen","x":"Starting with other revenue, we are maintaining our full year guidance of $310 million to $330 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/circle-crcl-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[64,1,10686,0,0,0,9297,899],[65,1,10507,0,0,0,8820,1152],[66,1,8775,0,0,0,8183,452],[67,1,10209,0,0,0,9411,592]],"cinema":[[64,1,10686,0,0,0,9297,899],[65,1,10507,0,0,0,8820,1152],[66,1,8775,0,0,0,8183,452],[67,1,10209,0,0,0,9411,592]],"imax":[[64,1,10686,0,0,0,9297,899],[65,1,10507,0,0,0,8820,1152],[66,1,8775,0,0,0,8183,452],[67,1,10209,0,0,0,9411,592]],"streaming":[[64,1,10686,0,0,0,9297,899],[65,1,10507,0,0,0,8820,1152],[66,1,8775,0,0,0,8183,452],[67,1,10209,0,0,0,9411,592]],"dtc":[[64,1,10686,0,0,0,9297,899],[65,1,10507